-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",174,{
[5537]="7000F65E\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred with the Lossoth of Forochel.\n",
[5538]="7001BA86\n1\tTalk to the proprietor of the Forsaken Inn\tMake your way to The Forsaken Inn. It can be found west along the the Great East Road, south of Candaith's camp. Candaith advised you to seek out the inhabitants of an Inn in the Lone-lands to offer your aid to them.\n",
[5539]="7004327E\n1\tSeek the Maiden of Sirith\030Seek the Maiden of Celos\030Seek the Maiden of Serni\tThe rivers of Sirith can be found throughout Upper and Lower Lebennin. The Sirith flows out of Tumladen, the Celos joins Sirith to the north of Erynos, and the Serni flows to the east and south of Ost Anglebed. Glassiel has asked you to seek an audience with the other Sisters of Lebennin in the hopes that they might calm the rage of the Lone Lady.\n2\tSeek the Maiden of Gilrain\tRoamingstar, the Maiden of Gilrain can be found in her glade to the north-east of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil. You have found and spoken to three of the Five Sisters. You should now seek the Maiden of Gilrain.\n",
[5540]="7005CE63\n1\tInvestigate Garânashmar\tGarânashmar perches above Kurdushâlak, in north-western Clovengap. Gerja has asked you to investigate Garânashmar.\n2\tCollect old coins (total: 12)\tAngmarim intruders can be found in Garânashmar. While investigating Garânashmar you found some old coins. Their features are worn down by time, but perhaps you could find others with clearer markings.\n3\tReturn to Gerja\tGerja is in Bazanmanar in north-eastern Clovengap. You should bring the old coins to Gerja.\n",
[5541]="7003715F\n1\tAid Tordag and his people against the Dunlendings at Torsbury\tTordag is at his camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. Tordag has asked you to join his garrison as they assault the Dunlendings at Torsbury. You should speak with him when you are ready to join him.\n2\tTalk to Torferth at Tordag's camp\tTorferth is at Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. You should speak with Torferth to discuss the failure of the counterassault.\n",
[5542]="70037155\n1\tBurn White Hand banners (total: 4)\030Burn White Hand tents (total: 4)\tYou should burn the banners and tents of the enemy.\n",
[5543]="7003715D\n1\tDefeat Frithmund before he escapes Torsbury\tFrithmund is attempting to escape. You should defeat Frithmund before he reaches the gates of Torsbury. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[5544]="700442FA\n1\tRepair barricades (total: 4)\030Place bear trap (total: 8)\tBroken barricades and spots for bear traps can be found around Crithost. You should repair barricades and set bear traps.\n2\tSpeak with Ceveneth\tCeveneth can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Ceveneth.\n",
[5545]="7002F063\n1\tCollect a bladder of grog from an Uruk in the East Wall\tUruks throughout the East Wall carry bladders of grog on their person with which they can fortify themselves. The dying Uruk you found wants a bladder of grog in exchange for telling you what happened at the Dead Orc Glade.\n2\tBring the bladder of grog to the dying Uruk\tThe dying Uruk is in the Dead Orc Glade, in the East Wall. You have found a bladder of grog and should bring it back to the dying Uruk.\n",
[5546]="700571BD\n1\tAssist Yrsa Spearwife with \"Protecting Limlók\"\030Assist Trygvar with \"Walls of Bramble\"\030Assist Sighild with \"Spies From Gundabad\"\030Assist Thyra with \"Depleted Stores\"\tYrsa Spearwife, Thyra, Sighild, and Trygvar can all be found in Limlók. You should assist each of them with their tasks.\n2\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.\n",
[5547]="70025B81\n1\tTalk to Kelsey West at Tinnudir\tKelsey West is in Tinnudir. Orchalwë is distrustful of the young man loitering at the Ranger's camp on Tinnudir and wants to know his motives.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë at Tinnudir\tOrchalwë is at Tinnudir. Orchalwë will be interested to hear what Kelsey had to say.\n3\tTalk to Kelsey West at Tinnudir\tKelsey West is at Tinnudir. Orchalwë asked you to inform Kelsey that the Rangers would help.\n4\tTalk to Basil Gummidge at Ost Forod\tBasil Gummidge is in Ost Forod, north-east of Tinnudir. Kelsey West and Orchalwë directed you to seek out the arbiter of Ost Forod and let him know the Rangers are ready to uphold their end of the pact.\n",
[5548]="7003EA78\n1\tDefeat bog-lurkers in the Blooming Fens (total: 6)\tThere are bog-lurkers in the Blooming Fens, along the Bruinen in the Trollshaws. While in the High Moor, you should put an end to the wild and corrupt bog-lurkers of the Blooming Fens.\n",
[5549]="70037082\n1\tBring the note you found to Ordlac\tThane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Oserley. Cenulf told you to bring the note you found to Thane Ordlac at once.\n",
[5550]="70000194\n1\tUse Roiling Water (total: 5)\030Collect Phial\tImlad Balchorth's pools are to the west of Myrkworth. The waters of the eastern Imlad Balchorth cause strange maladies, and Thorod wishes to determine the cause. He told you to take samples from the roiling patches in the pools.\n2\tBring the phial of water samples to Thorod\tThorod is in Myrkworth, east of Imlad Balchorth. Your phials are filled with water from the roiling pools of the Imlad Balchorth.\n",
[5551]="7003FF26\n1\tRemove poison (total: 4)\tIf the poison is removed quickly enough the waters may be saved.\n",
[5552]="7002C7D0\n1\tBring the hide of Foul-maw to Limfind\tLimfind is in Haldirith. You should bring the hide of Foul-maw to Limfind.\n",
[5553]="700266E3\n1\tDefeat kergrim in the Way of Kings (total: 8)\t\n2\tTalk to Rodlam in the Way of Kings\tRodlam is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam will be pleased to hear a number of kergrim have been defeated.\n",
[5554]="70047AE2\n1\tCollect Gondorian artifacts in The Towers of the Teeth (total: 5)\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should collect Gondorian artifacts scattered around the towers.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills. You should bring the artifacts you collected to Thurindol.\n",
[5555]="7003A4E3\n1\tCollect a bag of chicken-feed\tThe chicken-feed can be found to the south of Frethi, across the street at the supply-house. Frethi is having issues corralling his chickens and asked if you could collect a bag of feed for them.\n2\tTalk to Frethi\tFrethi is west of the Mead Hall of Fenmarch. You have collected the bag of chicken-feed for Frethi and should bring it to him, so he may feed his chickens.\n",
[5556]="7001752F\n1\tReturn the lamps to Pentlenn at the Shadowed Refuge\030Collect fractured rune-stones (total: 4)\030Collect shattered rune-stones (total: 10)\tThe Dark Delvings lie far to the south-east of the Shadowed Refuge. Pentlenn asked you to enter the Dark Delvings and collect the fractured and shattered runes there in an effort to restore their light.\n",
[5557]="7002D05C\n1\tFind the map-fragments (total: 5)\tThe guards' chests are on the second floor of the tower. You should search chests for fragments of the map.\n",
[5558]="70057E64\n1\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n2\tContinue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n3\tTalk to Léothred at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n",
[5559]="700582DD\n1\tTalk to Fróthi\tFróthi can be found next to Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Fróthi.\n2\tTalk to Léothred\tLéothred can be found next to Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Léothred.\n3\tTalk to Fróthi\tFróthi can be found next to Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Fróthi.\n",
[5560]="70057184\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Avabárg (total: 6)\tOrcs can be found at Avabárg. You should defeat Orcs at Avabárg.\n2\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tAvabárg can be found in Woodsedge in the Vales of Anduin. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n3\tContinue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tAvabárg can be found in Woodsedge in the Vales of Anduin. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n4\tTalk to Léothred at Avabárg\tLéothred can be found at Avabárg. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
[5561]="70057E67\n1\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n2\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n3\tContinue learning the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n4\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n5\tLocate ancient adornments at Framsburg (total: 8)\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should locate ancient adornments inside the keep at Framsburg.\n6\tTalk to Léothred near the keep at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n7\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n8\tTalk to Léothred near the keep at Framsburg\tLéothred can be found at Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n",
[5562]="7005780D\n1\tDestroy eggs (total: 12)\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should destroy the drake and worm eggs that were lain within Framsburg.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many eggs at Framsburg.\n",
[5563]="70057838\n1\tCollect relics within Framsburg (total: 12)\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should collect relics within Framsburg.\n2\tBring the relics to Hlithseld\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should bring the relics to Hlithseld.\n",
[5564]="70057839\n1\tDefeat bats at Framsburg (total: 10)\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should defeat bats at Framsburg.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many bats at Framsburg.\n",
[5565]="7005780B\n1\tDefeat drakes, worms, and avanc at Framsburg (total: 16)\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should defeat drakes, worms, and avanc at Framsburg.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many drakes, worms, and avanc at Framsburg.\n",
[5566]="7000B101\n1\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to come to the Ettenmoors to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkúlob. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkúlob.\n",
[5567]="7000B0FF\n1\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to come to the Ettenmoors to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors.\n",
[5568]="7000AF2B\n1\tExamine George\tYou think that perhaps it is time to escape Farmer Sandson's coop.\n",
